171 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 86 0 R
/T (Unibots creates a space for students to learn, understand, and compete in autonomous robotics. Through our approach of project-based learning, we provide an environment where students are able to apply and develop skills touched on by university, but often not explored in-depth. Those are often the very skills which employers look for - the ability to transfer knowledge and problem solve.)
/E (Unibots creates a space for students to learn, understand, and compete in autonomous robotics. Through our approach of project-based learning, we provide an environment where students are able to apply and develop skills touched on by university, but often not explored in-depth. Those are often the very skills which employers look for - the ability to transfer knowledge and problem solve.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
172 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 86 0 R
/T (Growing practical skills is just the start of it! Unibots also creates a space for students to connect with like-minded other students, providing networking opportunities with purpose. We want to encourage collaborations between universities and industry, sharing of employment opportunities, and even entrepreneurship. \(Did you know: 40-50% of UK-based startups were founded by university students!\))
/E (Growing practical skills is just the start of it! Unibots also creates a space for students to connect with like-minded other students, providing networking opportunities with purpose. We want to encourage collaborations between universities and industry, sharing of employment opportunities, and even entrepreneurship. \(Did you know: 40-50% of UK-based startups were founded by university students!\))
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
