/Title (Unibots creates a space for students to learn, understand, and compete in autonomous robotics. Through our approach of project-based learning, we provide an environment where students are able to apply and develop skills touched on by university, but often not explored in-depth. Those are often the very skills which employers look for - the ability to transfer knowledge and problem solve.)
