/Title (Growing practical skills is just the start of it! Unibots also creates a space for students to connect with like-minded other students, providing networking opportunities with purpose. We want to encourage collaborations between universities and industry, sharing of employment opportunities, and even entrepreneurship. \(Did you know: 40-50% of UK-based startups were founded by university students!\))
